          "name": "Nauseating Slap",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "A living creature struck by a demontangle's tendril must attempt a check (fortitude, dc:19) save. On a failure, the creature becomes Sickened 1. If the creature is already sickened, the condition value increases by 1, to a maximum of sickened 4.\nOnce a creature succeeds at its saving throw, it is temporarily immune for 24 hours.",
