          "id": "4r1v6qnOQPxNqVwr",
          "name": "Shadow Blending",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Frequency once per minute\nTrigger A creature attempts a flat check to target Varlario while they are Concealed or Hidden due to dim light or darkness\nEffect Shadows wrap around Varlario's form. The DC of the flat check increases by 2.",
