          "id": "dZXxGiQZC9DOZzVL",
          "name": "Correcting Veil",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "100 feet. The instillo's telepathic presence constantly monitors perspectives and molds thought toward an infernal clarity. Creatures within the aura gain the Dubious Knowledge skill feat but are unaware of this effect. The instillo is instantly aware when any creature within the aura fails a Recall Knowledge check and influences the erroneous information that the creature gains.",
