          "name": "Grave Tidings",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Requirement A grabbed, paralyzed, restrained, or unconscious creature is within Averill's reach\nEffect Averill whispers into the creature's ears, compelling them to join him. The creature is unable to attack Averill Quint for the duration, unless Averill uses a hostile action against them, and any undead Pathfinder can treat the creature as an ally for purposes of flanking. The creature must attempt a check (will, dc:21) save\nCritical Success The creature is temporarily immune for 1 minute.\nSuccess The creature is unaffected.\nFailure The curse lasts 1 round.\nCritical Failure The curse lasts 2 rounds.",
