          "name": "Planar Depressurization",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger A creature touches the sigil on the crate\nEffect The incomplete demonic pact causes the crate to explode. Bits of wood and energy from the Outer Rifts deal 2d8+5 bludgeoning damage] damage to all creatures within 10-foot emanation of it (check (reflex, dc:21, basic)).",
