      "disable": "check (arcana, dc:25) (trained) to repair Chamenaiti's magic, check (religion, dc:27) or check (occultism, dc:27) (trained) to offset the prayer, or Dispel Magic (4th rank; counteract DC 25) to counteract the warning",
      "isComplex": true,
      "routine": "a Rubbery crimson tentacles appear from a rip in the air and grasp at all creatures in the area, dealing 2d8 bludgeoning damage] damage (check (fortitude, dc:25, basic) save).",
