          "description": "Trigger A creature within 30 feet deals damage to Matriarch Szvetneera\nEffect The Ulfen bodyguard lets out a threating bellow at whoever injured their ward. They then attempt a check to Demoralize against the triggering creature, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to the check.",
