          "name": "Back Away!",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The Ulfen bodyguard attacks the target, pushing them back and away from their charge. The bodyguard makes a Strike against the creature, then attempts to Shove their target. Depending on the outcome of their Strike, there may be additional effects.\nCritical Success The Ulfen bodyguard gains a +2 circumstance bonus to their attempt to Shove.\nSuccess The Ulfen bodyguard gains a +1 circumstance bonus to their attempt to Shove.\nFailure There is no effect.\nCritical Failure The Ulfen bodyguard is Off-Guard until the start of their next turn.",
