          "name": "Winter's Bite",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "30 feet. check (fortitude, dc:18) save. Hostile creatures within this aura gain weakness 3 to cold. A successful Fortitude save negates this effect for 1 minute.\nEffect: Winter's Bite",
