          "name": "Icy Protection",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Whenever Szvetneera Casts a Spell with the cold trait, she can choose to grant one of her bodyguards resistance to cold 3 until the beginning of Szvetneera's next turn.\nEffect: Icy Protection",
