          "name": "Shackling Cold",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Matriarch Szvetneera uses her mastery of ice magic to hobble a target. If her next action is to Cast a Spell with the cold trait, that spell also gives the target a –10 circumstance penalty to their Speed until the beginning of Szvetneera's next turn if they are affected.\nEffect: Shackling Cold",
