          "name": "Cybernetics",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "The cybernetics of a cybernetic zombie can be disabled for 1 hour with a successful Disable Device DC 15 check. A zombie's cybernetics are disabled for 1 hour if it takes any electricity damage. A cybernetic zombie with disabled cybernetics is Slowed 1 and can't use reactions (including self-destruct).",
