          "name": "Drain Bonded Item",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Frequency once per day\nRequirements Luxia hasn't acted yet on this turn\nEffect Luxia expends the power stored in her +1 staff. This gives her the ability to cast one prepared spell she had already previously cast today without spending a spell slot. Luxia must still Cast the Spell and meet the spell's other requirements.",
