          "description": "Trigger Luxia would be hit by a melee attack\nEffect One of the floating skulls of Luxia's previous lovers interferes with the attack, granting Luxia a +2 circumstance bonus to her AC. The skull is then destroyed. Once all three skulls are destroyed in this way, Luxia can no longer use this reaction.",
