          "description": "Marius makes a quick hop through the Pit to reappear close to an enemy in a cloud of brimstone and ash. Marius teleports to any square within 15 feet that is within reach of another creature, then makes a melee Strike against one creature within his reach. This movement does not provoke reactions.",
