          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The retriever makes a ranged eye ray Strike against an enemy within 60 feet. On a hit, the retriever chooses one of the four options listed below. The retriever cannot use the same effect in consecutive rounds. Once the retriever has used all four options, the eye ray Strike can't be used for 1d4.\n• Cold The enemy takes 2d12+13 cold damage\n• Electricity The enemy takes 2d12+13 electricity damage\n• Fire The enemy takes 2d12+13 fire damage\n• Petrification The enemy is targeted by a 6th-rank Petrify using the retriever's innate spell DC (check (fortitude, dc:26, traits:earth)).",
