          "name": "Pike and Strike",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The plunderer makes a melee Strike with their naval pike. If this Strike hits, the plunderer can either move the target 5 feet within the pike's reach or make a fist Strike against the target without increasing their multiple attack penalty until after the first Strike.",
          "traits": []
