          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Shadow Lesolethe causes the shadows cast by those around her to transform into a mesh of blades which erupt upwards at her foes in a 30-foot type:emanation. Enemy creatures in the area take 4d6 slashing damage (check (reflex, dc:24, basic, options:area-effect) save).",
