          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Requirements The disciple has their crimson cloak raised\nTrigger The disciple is attacked by a melee weapon\nEffect After the attack's result is resolved, the disciple attempts to Disarm the triggering weapon, gaining a +1 circumstance bonus. The cloak is destroyed after this action.",
