          "description": "Trigger Rowan has thrown her Serpent Dagger at a target\nFrequency once per turn\nEffect After the attack's result is resolved, Rowan yanks on the cord attached to the weapon's hilt, returning it to her hand. If she throws the weapon to a distance of 20 feet or beyond, this ability becomes 1-action and gains the manipulate trait.",
