      "hardness": 0,
      "stealth": {
        "modifier": 8,
        "details": ""
      },
      "disable": "check (type:arcana,nature,thievery, dc:18) (trained) three times to counter the planar energies.",
      "isComplex": true,
      "routine": "(3 actions) On its turn each round, the wind begins blowing fiercely from a random direction. All creatures must attempt a check (type:reflex, dc:18) save.\nCritical Success The creature is unaffected.\nSuccess The creature is moved 5 feet in the direction the wind is blowing.\nFailure The creature is moved 10 feet in the direction the wind is blowing and is knocked Prone.\nCritical Failure The creature is moved 10 feet in the direction the wind is blowing, is knocked prone, and is Stunned 1.",
