          "name": "Jack of All Actions",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The Associate attempts an Acrobatics, Athletic, Deception, or Intimidation check that uses no more than one action against a creature then makes a strike against the same creature. If the skill action succeeded the strike is made with a +1 circumstance bonus to the attack roll and deals an additional 1d8 precision damage.",
