          "name": "Captain's Command",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Frequency once per round\nEffect Captain Conziva orders an ally to attack or to get in position. Until the end of the ally's next turn, they gain the captain's choice of a +2 status bonus to attack rolls or a +10-foot status bonus to their Speeds.\nEffect: Bosun's Command",
